# Build output. Generated from brand/ + email/copy/campaign.json by `npm run build`,
# and rebuilt by Vercel on every deploy, so committing it only creates a second
# source of truth that goes stale. It used to be committed, which is how a stale
# dist could disagree with the copy deck without anything erroring.
